ckend, verify API endpoints end-to-end and lint/typecheck\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Probe toolchain/network availability for pip + npm deps (markdown, tailwind, typography)","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement Flask backend: SQLite schema, auth, notes CRUD, markdown rendering, public endpoints, static serving","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Update backend requirements.txt + requirements.lock","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Set up Tailwind CSS entry + Vite/PostCSS config, update frontend deps and lock","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Build React frontend: auth, notes list, editor with live preview, publish switch/link, public page","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Build frontend, run backend, verify API endpoints end-to-end and lint/typecheck","status":"pending","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"5 todos","time":{"start":1794375605785,"end":1794375605789}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c91ede12001rLsXInCYQAp5t4","sessionID":"ses_e36f19058ffeXfAI4v8uekZO02","messageID":"msg_1c91ecb3000105XhyBWTDPW6xn"}}
